# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): the pages, the knobs, the help cards and each new tune
wait 300
listen
wait 300
where
wait 300
said Band page: Tempo 100%, Harp 55, Drive 45, Room 40
tap ENV
wait 400
said Mix page
spin K1 -3
wait 300
said Piano 67
tap EDIT
wait 300
said NEXT TUNE
wait 6000
said Tune 2
press SAVE
wait 1200
said SAVE button. SAVES EVERY NIGHT
release SAVE
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 300
said PAUSED
where
wait 300
said paused
speakdump
